<title>USA: Snyder to provide Enron marketing services.</title>
<headline>Snyder to provide Enron marketing services.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snyder Communications Inc said Monday it signed a three-year agreement to provide targeted outsourced marketing services to Enron Corp.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed, Snyder said.</p>
<p>Initially, Snyder will be marketing natural gas and electricity delivery services on behalf of Enron Capital &amp; Trade Resources Corp, targeting small business customers.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
